# Files that must NOT be publicly servable from the deployed site, even
# though they live in this repo's root (which is the assets directory per
# wrangler.jsonc). Netlify's publish="." never excluded any of these, so
# they've been publicly fetchable at klarmoney.netlify.app the whole time —
# fixed here going forward for the Cloudflare deploy.

# Internal business/strategy docs — never public
klar-beta-findings.md
klar-competitive-brief.md
klar-error-handling-review.md
klar-financial-model.html
klar-pitch-materials.md
klar-review-accounts-budget-tax.md
klar-review-properties-holdings-networth.md
klar-review-subs-split-insurance-ai.md
klar-sa-funding-landscape.md
klar-sa-seed-application-draft.md

# One-off dev utility, not linked from the live app
generate-assets.html

# Supabase Edge Function source — deployed separately via Supabase, not
# meant to be served as static files here
functions/

# Config files — not meant to be served as literal downloadable files
# (_headers/_redirects exclusion is Cloudflare's own recommended practice)
netlify.toml
wrangler.jsonc
_headers
_redirects
.gitignore
